WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:03.400
This is amazing.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.500
I never, never thought I could do this.

3
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:15.800
I haven't been able to do something like
this in 30 years, since before I had MS.

4
00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:22.700
People with serious disabilities, they may
never have had an experience like this,

5
00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:25.000
and they deserve it.

6
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.900
[Music]
